blurb = "Depicts Mount Fuji towering above Hara (literally \"field\"). The peak is cut off by the frame to emphasize the mountain's altitude.

Hara was a smaller post town on the coast of Suruga Bay between Numazu and Yoshiwara. The area is in present-day Numazu, Shizuoka prefecture."
